    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<div class="control-header" aria-hidden="false">
<div class="controls">
<div class="umb-property-editor db">
<div class="umb-property-editor umb-rte --initialized">
<div class="umb-rte-editor-con">
<p><strong>If your work relies on concrete testing, this comprehensive guide is for you.</strong></p>
<p>In this guide we will walk you through all the stages of concrete testing for construction, showing you exactly what to expect and how each stage contributes to your success.<br /><br /></p>
<p><em>Mix Designs  |    Non-Destructive Testing  |  Concrete Sampling  |  Concrete Strength  </em><em> |   Concrete Durability</em></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>]]></Value>
