            "udi": "umb://element/af5e212690354b97ba936038768a0292",
            "title": "Concrete Coring",
            "description": "Moisture content at which a fine-grained soil can not be remolded.",
            "image": [
              {
                "key": "2989b8e5-7c7d-45b3-8a41-b6403e261d05",
                "mediaKey": "d02f9bb3-6d58-4a20-bbd3-ff73cf27885b",
                "crops": [],
